            "notes": "\ud83e\udeb6**Round 5** with [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) you will give your team mated when you use Guardian Angel on them even when the staff is not attached an little Ana nade effect, it can save them for a second but i would really recommend to attach your staff as soon as possible.\nUse [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) for more movement and an shorter cooldown for your guardian angel.\nWith [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) you will have 30% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), if you have some money left you can pick  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) or [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) for a bit [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) too.",
